## Structure

```
src/
├── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Api/            ← REST adapters (controllers)
├── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Application/    ← ports (interfaces) + services
├── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Domain/         ← entities, aggregates, value objects
└── {{pascalCase projectName}}.Infrastructure/ ← persistence, messaging adapters
```

Domain is the innermost layer. Application defines ports that Infrastructure implements.

